WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A working inventory, built with oof/ui. Equip your blade and return to the game.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Add the project skill with oofui skill add. The CLI is already installed.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Ask your agent: add a player inventory with search and equip actions. Use Adventure.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The actual agent session: read the skill, install the kits, connect game state, and build.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Open that exact game in Roblox Studio Play. Press B to open the new inventory.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Filter supplies, search for tonic, clear the search, and equip the Wayfinder blade.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000
One follow-up: switch to Grove and keep the same items and behavior.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Grove in the same game. Selection and equipped item are preserved.
